(text "INPUTS 1-4: PROTECTED SENSING AND ADC" (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid 20c2032e-539b-5053-a095-8d77f33f7a35))
(text "Two 165k resistors limit input current.\nD1-D12 clamp switch SOURCE pins only.\n100k source bleeds permit startup with DUT connected.\nSwitches isolate ADC and bias when disabled." (at 25 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 3419fce8-b71d-53c7-a0d5-9230662a6e65))
(text "1nF filters are on the ADC side.\nVpin difference = 37.3 x ADC voltage difference (nominal).\nMeasure one live DC pair, other terminals open." (at 230 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 9fcddf44-a333-5730-8ce7-997d7a9022fb))
(text "12V nominal; 0-18V intended measurement range.\n48V DC miswire target requires prototype verification.\nDo not connect any terminal directly to AGND or USB_GND." (at 25 242 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid 185ba123-b618-5b3e-9e61-fdd3cdcd15d8))
)
